    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a little surprised.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I've come to turn my back on the faith?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because of what you're evading, Stefano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know whether you're under some outside influence, but if...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are no ifs, Aulus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am not so far gone that Arts would sway me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are times when Arts doesn't need to change our minds at all. All too many things can impact us, Stefano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are asking that I reconsider. Why, heretic priest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this decision of mine not what you always wanted to see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't deny it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in turn, I have to recognize that back when this extraordinary building was still in Iberia, it was my fortune to study here, and those days were precious like little else to me then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "In this way, Stefano, I'm just like you. I feel for this place, just as you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember the cleric who came with you from Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember very many.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one you recall took his gun, sixty years ago, and made the decision to fall in line with the Church of then. While I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I chose to stay behind, and protect those who were left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this fed your faith, enduring until now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you know so well, why would you still have me continue to wait, to endure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you about to refute all that you've maintained and proclaimed, just to turn around and tell me to deliberate, exhort me to stay fast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not. Stefano, you know I wouldn't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at core, I walk the path I believe is right, and so I would hope I could say the same of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tomorrow morning, should you still be committed, I will consider it your choice then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will prepare what you need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you are not yet decided, I will advise you to continue contemplation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever it may be... I hope your decision will be that you find truest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aulus, you wrongly assume one thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what is right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am lost for any other choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. Should this be Truth's ordain...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I will welcome you, Stefano, my brother anew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Aulus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
