    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mind if I come in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "'Scuse me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not doing too hot, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can I ask a question?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is... Is Fina not...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "With us anymore?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to push you, but I'd prefer some other question.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not really up for lying to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#4$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I had an inkling all along...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "When it happened, I just suddenly\u2014couldn't feel Fina anymore... even though she was so angry, and so upset...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "And she was right there in front of me, right...? But I couldn't find her anywhere...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I hadn't helped you fix up that gun...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#6$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#5$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say it, please...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4015_spuria_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Serpilia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#10$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I felt the horns\u2014on my head. They're horns just like Raimund's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't ever pray holding my gun again, but at least...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_927_1#1$2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I finally\u2014fit in, with Raimund, and Caroline...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "text": "I fit in with everybody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fortuna"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
