        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$escape_intro",
        "key": "$escape_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Repeat that... we have a fallen angel? That Fortuna girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't expecting that one, let me tell you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fallen... Our only option is to hold on until we get back, then let His Holiness decide. It's not something we can handle right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that surprise visitor who barged into my room is a different story. Federico, there's some things I'll explain to you later... for now, anything's a non-starter unless we find that visitor, whatever it is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I require your assistance, Executor Federico.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It has mobility on its side. I managed to chase it down this far, but that was a stretch, and I've lost it now anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh, no immediate reply?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's rare. You're making me feel like something bad happened to you... Hey, I see those knit brows. Something bad did happen, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I heard strings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Strings? Did... you? I don't think I heard anything...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on my inference, the sound came from the sacrarium on the top floor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me be real. I've gotten to know the length and breadth of your work at the Notarial Hall, which is why I'm relatively willing to trust your judgment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am now formally querying you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Notarial Hall Executor Federico, do you truly believe this unidentified, unascertained, and possibly completely benign sound of strings\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stands to be more important than the request for assistance I'm making of you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It does not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Obviously not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The occurrence of the sound is a chance event. I have suspicions about it, but I cannot deny that I as of yet find no direct correlation between it and our catalog of current affairs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on present circumstances, I judge that priority should be given to providing requisite assistance, in tandem operation with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heheh. All done then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, I'm not here to bully you anyway. Just, I do need to check in with how you're doing real quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Point me in a direction. I'll continue target pursuit, and I'll leave you to sort out the strings debacle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This mission requires that we prioritize assuring yours and Oren's safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Due diligence is great and all, but I say priority's the kind of thing you need to judge yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't sense your emotions, Federico. Still, I have this Liberi friend, see, who's the reason I learned long ago how to guess what people are thinking. Couldn't do empathy with her, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "She might be a lot easier to figure out than you are, but some things carry over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "One teensy little word of advice\u2014maybe sometimes, you need to learn to trust your instinct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That settles that. We don't have time to waste... and I've gotta force myself to be a little active anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_925_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Operation a-go! Move out, everyone~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "39_g8_outsidepath",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
