        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crowdrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speed up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Senior Federico! W\u2014Wait one moment, please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly do... you think is up there? It was just the sound of strings, and we can't even hear it anymore!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are\u2014Are we really going to let the seniora brave the danger on her own? She's in a wheelchair, after all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have no need to worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I <i>not</i> worry? I just saw it myself... it was a monster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemuen was admitted into the Lateran by personal invitation of a Cardinal of the Seventh Tribunal. Her strength defies any contempt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not underestimate her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't quite follow what you're telling me\u2014I assume you mean she's just as mighty herself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... what if?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Speed up. Or stay where you are and wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I suggest you pick the latter. It is the safer option.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "39_g2_abandonsancturay",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Empty?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(No.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_gunload"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Subtle noises spill through the spacious sacrarium. The loading of the gun keeps audible lockstep rhythm."
    },
    {
        "text": "The executor suddenly points."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_gunequip",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will only warn you once more. Come out from there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... he found us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lively Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He found us. He's just like the lady said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shy Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, the big man found us right away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lively Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is\u2014Is he really the man she was talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shy Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's got the wings and ring and they're all black. It's him, must be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lively Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$calm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister, my name is Erendel!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lively Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm Estara...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shy Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where is the woman who described me to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He looks really, really scary...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too scary! And you didn't even say your name... that's just rude!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mamma says if you don't know someone's name and they're a stranger, you shouldn't tell them anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Senior Federico's scary. Is he a good guy...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I bet he is! Just like in the story.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "W\u2014We can tell him, then, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Probably we can?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone told us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We had to wait here for a really scary big man with a black ring on his head just like she has!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And she\u2014she said you'd find Mamma with us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_928_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah! And also she said we were only allowed to wait a little, tiny bit! And if you didn't come, then we come out ourselves.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Erendel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_929_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... she said we couldn't stay here forever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
    {
        "text": "And also, also, she said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Estara"
    },
